# MV3 service worker = orchestrator only

The **background service worker** (`src/background/index.ts`) must **not** implement long-running or heavyweight work.

## Do not add to the service worker

- **`fetch`** for AI, OpenRouter, or arbitrary proxy URLs (use **`forwardToOffscreen`** with `PROXY_REQUEST` / `OPENROUTER_COMPLETE` in `src/offscreen/offscreen.ts`).
- **`@openrouter/ai-sdk-provider`**, **`ai`** / `generateText`, or other LLM client code.
- **`@huggingface/transformers`**, ONNX Runtime Web, or zero-shot classification.
- **`youtubei.js` / Innertube** (`getBasicInfo`, player, etc.).

## Do instead

- **Route** `chrome.runtime.onMessage` and **ensure** the offscreen document via `src/background/orchestrator.ts` (`forwardToOffscreen`, `handleOffscreenRpc`).
- Keep **storage/settings** helpers that only touch `chrome.storage` or `chrome.action` / `chrome.windows` in the SW when they are trivial synchronous orchestration.

## Regression check

Before merging changes that touch `src/background/`, confirm the built **`dist/background/index.js`** does not newly bundle ORT, Transformers, OpenRouter, or youtubei.js. Heavy deps belong in **`src/offscreen/`**.
